abstract: >-
  BioVoice is a local research prototype for voice control in
  structural biology visualization. It connects PyMOL and ChimeraX
  to the OpenAI Realtime API via WebRTC, enabling hands-free control
  of molecular scenes through natural language. It includes curated
  workflows for AlphaFold, Rosetta, cryo-EM, ligand-pocket stories,
  and structural biology presentations.
